flowchart TB
    A[Approved research question<br/>and protocol] --> B[Document purpose, data permissions,<br/>customer information and governance]
    B --> C[Application, M-Pesa, CRB<br/>and affordability evidence]
    C --> D[Data quality, coverage<br/>and feature construction]
    D --> E[Mandatory eligibility and fraud filters<br/>define marginal pool and strata]
    E --> F[Reproducible 80:20 allocation<br/>assignment ID and immutable log]
    F --> G[Control group<br/>existing decision]
    F --> H[Treatment group<br/>controlled credit offer]
    G --> I[Capture permitted<br/>common outcomes]
    H --> J[Acceptance, disbursement<br/>and servicing]
    J --> K[Track repayment, arrears, default,<br/>fraud and customer outcomes]
